    /// Empty-template semantics differ per consumer:
    ///   * 0.2 `Network.allows()` → deny-all (legacy capability gate).
    ///   * 0.3 raw-socket `templateAllows` (tcp-connect, udp-connect,
    ///     udp-send) → allow-all. Embedders that don't seed the
